# Copy to .dev.vars for `pnpm dev`. Deploy to Cloudflare asks for each line that isn't commented.
# The password the admin pages ask for. Make up a long one.
ADMIN_PASSWORD=
# 32 random bytes as hex, from which the Worker derives the key that encrypts your publisher
# credentials. `pnpm run deploy` makes one on the first deploy; for `pnpm dev`, run
# `openssl rand -hex 32` and paste it here.
# APP_SECRET=
